OL,4,                                   G1/2 
OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GThis Evening and Tonight:FA mixture of 
OL,8,Fcloud and clear spells for most        
OL,9,Ftonight, with temperatures falling     
OL,10,Faway sharply where skies clear leading 
OL,11,Fto a patchy frost by dawn. In the      
OL,12,Fnortheast, showers feed through,       
OL,13,Fwintry over hills. Feeling chilly in   
OL,14,Fan easterly breeze.                    
OL,16,GThursday:FIt will be cloudy and dry    
OL,17,Ffor most on Thursday, while still      
OL,18,Ffeeling cold with temperatures below   
OL,19,Faverage. Heavy rain and strong winds   
OL,20,Farrive in northwestern areas in the    
OL,21,Fafternoon.                             
OL,23,D]C        From the Met Office          
