OL,4,CUS announces new tariffs on host of    
OL,5,Ccountries including China              
OL,6,GThe US has announced a fresh raft of   
OL,7,Gtariffs as President Donald Trump      
OL,8,Gpushes ahead with his signature trade  
OL,9,Gpolicy.                                
OL,11,FThe new taxes charged on imports to    
OL,12,FAmerica are set to hit many of the     
OL,13,Fcountry's biggest trading partners -   
OL,14,FChina, the European Union and 12 other 
OL,15,Fjurisdictions.                         
OL,17,FThe move follows the White House's     
OL,18,Finvestigation into the trade practices 
OL,19,Fof other countries in March after the  
OL,20,FUS Supreme Court ruled Trump's         
OL,21,Fpreviously announced Liberation Day    
OL,22,Ftariffs were illegal.                  
