OL,4,CUS approves SpaceX plan to send a      
OL,5,Cmillion data satellites to space       
OL,6,GUS regulators have given SpaceX the go-
OL,7,Gahead to launch a million satellites   
OL,8,Ginto Earth's orbit to help build data  
OL,9,Gcentres in space - the first approval  
OL,10,Gof its kind.                           
OL,12,FThe company, which is owned by Elon    
OL,13,FMusk, wants to use sunlight to power   
OL,14,Fsatellites that will process data for  
OL,15,FAI and send the results back to Earth. 
OL,17,FThe Federal Communications Commission  
OL,18,F(FCC) said on Wednesday that the       
OL,19,Fproject, known as Starmind, will       
OL,20,F"support America's booming super       
OL,21,Fintelligence economy".                 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
