OL,4,CGordon Ramsay to host Top Gear as show 
OL,5,Crevived after Flintoff crash           
OL,6,GTV chef Gordon Ramsay is to lead the   
OL,7,Gnew presenting line-up on BBC motoring 
OL,8,Gshow Top Gear, which is being revived  
OL,9,Gfour years after it was last on air.   
OL,11,FRamsay will take the driving seat      
OL,12,Falongside as yet unnamed co-presenters 
OL,13,Fwhen the show starts filming next      
OL,14,Fyear. It will return to screens in     
OL,15,F2028.                                  
OL,17,FThe long-running programme has been    
OL,18,Foff air since 2022, when co-host       
OL,19,FAndrew Flintoff suffered serious       
OL,20,Ffacial and rib injuries after his open-
OL,21,Ftopped three-wheeled car overturned at 
OL,22,Fthe show's test-track.                 
