OL,4,CUS stocks fall further as fears over   
OL,5,CAI intensify                           
OL,6,GBig technology firms connected to AI   
OL,7,Gcontinued to see share prices fall on  
OL,8,GWednesday, with stock in Nvidia and    
OL,9,GAnthropic dropping sharply in early    
OL,10,Gtrading.                               
OL,12,FThe surge in Nvidia shares after boss  
OL,13,FJensen Huang was reinstated was        
OL,14,Ftemporary, and the general stock sell- 
OL,15,Foff continued, with all three main US  
OL,16,Fstock market indices down by closing   
OL,17,Ftime. The tech-dominated Nasdaq closed 
OL,18,F0.6% lower.                            
