OL,4,CUS Army says controlled blast of       
OL,5,Cexplosives in Iowa was 'huge success'  
OL,6,GThe US military has hailed as a "huge  
OL,7,Gsuccess" the detonation of nearly five 
OL,8,Gtonnes of toxic explosives in Iowa, an 
OL,9,Goperation that sparked fears of health 
OL,10,Gand environmental problems across the  
OL,11,Gregion.                                
OL,13,FSmoke was seen rising into the sky     
OL,14,Fshortly after 09:00 local time (14:00  
OL,15,FGMT) following the explosion, as the   
OL,16,FArmy declared the risk "as close to    
OL,17,Fzero as is absolutely humanly          
OL,18,Fpossible".                             
